OL,3,CBurnham says he is not embarrassed
OL,4,Cabout exchange with Trump aide
OL,5,Cimpersonator
OL,7,FAndy Burnham has said he is not
OL,8,Fembarrassed by the exchange of
OL,9,Fmessages he had with someone
OL,10,Fpretending to be Donald Trump's chief
OL,11,Fof staff.
OL,13,FThe prime minister was in contact with
OL,14,Fan unknown person who pretended to be
OL,15,Ftop White House aide Susie Wiles, but
OL,16,Fhe grew suspicious after several
OL,17,Fmessages and reported the incident.
OL,19,FSpeaking with reporters on Tuesday, he
OL,20,Finsisted he had handled the incident
OL,21,Fproperly.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787102284
OL,3,CBurnham says he is not embarrassed
OL,4,Cabout exchange with Trump aide
OL,5,Cimpersonator
OL,7,F"No, I'm not, because there was a
OL,8,Fminimal exchange, nothing of
OL,9,Fconsequence, and actually, quickly I
OL,10,Frealised that this needed to be
OL,11,Freported, and I did so," he said.
OL,13,F"So I handled it in the right way. All
OL,14,Fpoliticians are receiving these
OL,15,Fpressures and these challenges, but I
OL,16,Fdid everything right.
OL,18,F"There was a minimal exchange of
OL,19,Finformation of zero consequence, and
OL,20,Fit was quickly reported."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUzD@AOU|D@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
