OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787102284
OL,3,CBurnham says he is not embarrassed
OL,4,Cabout exchange with Trump aide
OL,5,Cimpersonator
OL,7,FMs Wiles' phone had previously been
OL,8,Fhacked, according to reports in the US.
OL,10,FBut a US official told Politico that
OL,11,Fthe incident involving Burnham was not
OL,12,Frelated to this.
OL,14,FLast year, The Wall Street Journal
OL,15,Freported that the FBI had launched an
OL,16,Finvestigation into attempts to access
OL,17,FMs Wiles' phone after an unknown
OL,18,Fperson contacted well-known
OL,19,FRepublicans and business leaders while
OL,20,Fpretending to be her.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
