OL,3,CBurnham says he is not embarrassed
OL,4,Cabout exchange with Trump aide
OL,5,Cimpersonator
OL,7,FTrump later appeared not to be aware
OL,8,Fof the incident, saying to reporters
OL,9,Fat the White House about Burnham: "I'm
OL,10,Fsure that he had a miscommunication."
OL,12,FBurnham is not the first high-profile
OL,13,FBritish political figure to have come
OL,14,Finto contact with an impostor.
OL,16,FFootage of a hoax call in which then-
OL,17,FForeign Secretary Lord David Cameron
OL,18,Fbelieved he was speaking to former
OL,19,FUkrainian President Petro Poroshenko
OL,20,Fwas released by the UK Government in
OL,21,F2024.
OL,26,@qD@cOUrD@eO]
