OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FThe Foreign Office said the
OL,13,Fperpetrators in that case were
OL,14,F"clearly Russian" and made the
OL,15,Fincident public in a bid to pre-empt
OL,16,Fany effort to manipulate the video.
OL,18,FIn 2022, then-home secretary Priti
OL,19,FPatel and then-defence secretary Ben
OL,20,FWallace were also targeted by hoaxers
OL,21,Fsuspected of working for the Kremlin.
